gt.blockmachines.multimachine.FOG.introduction=§N引言
gt.blockmachines.multimachine.FOG.introductioninfotext=諸神之鍛爐中有許多內容，一開始可能會讓人感到困惑。本選單旨在解釋鍛爐中發生的一切，以及所有功能機制。
gt.blockmachines.multimachine.FOG.tableofcontents=§N目錄
gt.blockmachines.multimachine.FOG.fuel=燃料
gt.blockmachines.multimachine.FOG.modules=模組
gt.blockmachines.multimachine.FOG.upgrades=升級
gt.blockmachines.multimachine.FOG.milestones=里程碑
gt.blockmachines.multimachine.FOG.inversion=反轉

gt.blockmachines.multimachine.FOG.fuelinfotext.1=在諸神之鍛爐完成搭建併成型後，僅僅啟動機器並不能使其工作。鍛爐需要一定量的§b恆星燃料§6（物品形式的）以啟動。
gt.blockmachines.multimachine.FOG.fuelinfotext.2=恆星燃料的需求量取決於當前的燃料消耗係數，該係數可在控制器的燃料配置選單中設定。預設最大值為5，但之後可透過升級提高。恆星燃料的消耗按如下公式計算：
gt.blockmachines.multimachine.FOG.fuelinfotext.3=係數*25*1.2^係數
gt.blockmachines.multimachine.FOG.fuelinfotext.4=恆星燃料可以透過輸入匯流排供應。它會週期性的消耗並快取在鍛爐內部。快取的恆星燃料足夠時，機器便會真正開始執行（允許模組連線），並將消耗的恆星燃料轉換為儲存的§b星輝燃料§6。
gt.blockmachines.multimachine.FOG.fuelinfotext.5=從現在開始，鍛爐必須透過特定的液體燃料供能（型別可在燃料配置選單中選擇）。如果輸入倉中沒有足夠的所選燃料，儲存的燃料量就會減少；一旦降至0，熔爐便會進入之前的“關閉”狀態——模組斷開連線，並且必須重新供應恆星燃料才能啟動。
gt.blockmachines.multimachine.FOG.fuelinfotext.6=內部儲存的星輝燃料（液體）量可透過開啟§b電池充電§6來增加；這會使燃料消耗翻倍，但其中一半會存入內部電池。

gt.blockmachines.multimachine.FOG.moduleinfotext.1=諸神之鍛爐擁有四種可用模組，分別是太陽烈焰能量鍛爐、太陽射流融化核心、太陽熱能等離子製造機太陽聚變異化器。使用這些模組需要在諸神之鍛爐的指定位置分別建造對應的多方塊結構。
gt.blockmachines.multimachine.FOG.moduleinfotext.2=搭建完成後，模組需要與諸神之鍛爐建立連線。若對應模組的前置需求已被滿足，連結將自動建立。另外，如果不想等待自動重新整理，模組的控制器中有手動重新整理連線狀態的按鍵。每個模組都有專屬的特殊功能以及前置需求，並受到部分神鍛升級的影響
gt.blockmachines.multimachine.FOG.moduleinfotext.forge.1=太陽烈焰能量鍛爐
gt.blockmachines.multimachine.FOG.moduleinfotext.forge.2=第一個解鎖的模組，簡單的來說就是比放熱壁爐還強大的超級高爐。此外，本模組還擁有§b熔爐模式§6，能將其變為一個超級強大的工業熔爐。此模組在預設狀態下即可使用，並擁有§b1024§6的基礎並行數。
gt.blockmachines.multimachine.FOG.moduleinfotext.core.1=太陽射流融化核心
gt.blockmachines.multimachine.FOG.moduleinfotext.core.2=第二個解鎖的模組，同樣處理高爐配方，但效果有所不同：產物會以§b熔融態§6排出，而非以錠的形式。若某種產物沒有熔融態，則會以常規形態輸出。該模組需透過升級解鎖才能使用，並擁有§b512§6基礎並行數。
gt.blockmachines.multimachine.FOG.moduleinfotext.fab.1=太陽熱能等離子製造機
gt.blockmachines.multimachine.FOG.moduleinfotext.fab.2=第三個解鎖的模組，擁有獨特的配方樹，能將材料直接轉化為等離子體。這些配方按兩種屬性分組：§b聚變等級§6與§b合成所需步驟§6，限制了在各自升級解鎖之前可以處理哪些配方。與常規聚變不同，這些配方會產出輸入材料的等離子體。該模組擁有§b512§6基礎並行數。
gt.blockmachines.multimachine.FOG.moduleinfotext.exotic.1=太陽聚變異化器
gt.blockmachines.multimachine.FOG.moduleinfotext.exotic.2=第四個、也是最後一個解鎖的模組，能夠生產§b夸克膠子等離子體§6，並在後續產出§b磁物質§6。該模組在自動化這兩種材料時各有獨特的挑戰，且建議準備兩個此類模組，因為它們只能同時產出其中一種材料。
gt.blockmachines.multimachine.FOG.moduleinfotext.exotic.3=兩種模式的自動化挑戰都有一條共同規則：模組在配方週期開始時輸出材料，並等待正確的輸入抵達後，才開始對輸出材料進行實際加工。
gt.blockmachines.multimachine.FOG.moduleinfotext.exotic.4=If producing §bQuark Gluon Plasma§6, the module outputs up to 7 different fluids/dusts with amounts between 1-64 and 1-7 respectively, and their corresponding plasmas and amounts have to be returned in order for the recipe to process. For each L of fluid, a bucket of plasma and for each dust 9 ingots worth of plasma must be returned for the recipe to work.
gt.blockmachines.multimachine.FOG.moduleinfotext.exotic.5=If §bMagmatter Mode§6 is active, the automation challenge changes. Now the module outputs 1-50L of §bTachyon Rich Temporal Fluid§6, 51-100L of §bSpatially Enlarged Fluid§6 and one dust of a high tier material. The challenge is to return both the Tachyon Rich and Spatially Enlarged Fluids, plus as much plasma of the dust's material (in ingots) as the difference between the amounts of Spatially Enlarged and Tachyon Rich Fluid. Once all of these have been returned in the correct amounts, the recipe will start to process and output Magmatter.
gt.blockmachines.multimachine.FOG.moduleinfotext.exotic.6=此模組擁有§b64§6基礎並行數

gt.blockmachines.multimachine.FOG.upgradeinfotext.1=Upgrades are the heart and soul of the Forge, they unlock most of its functionality and processing power. The §bUpgrade Tree§6 can be accessed via its button on the main GUI, and each upgrade node can be clicked for more information on its effects and unlock requirements.
gt.blockmachines.multimachine.FOG.upgradeinfotext.2=In general, each upgrade can only be unlocked if the prior one is unlocked and there are enough available §bGraviton Shards§6. One exception to this is the first upgrade, which has no prior upgrade. Some upgrades also have extra material costs, which are denoted next to the unlock button if applicable.
gt.blockmachines.multimachine.FOG.upgradeinfotext.3=If an upgrade has more than one connected prior upgrade, then there are two options. The upgrade requires either:
gt.blockmachines.multimachine.FOG.upgradeinfotext.4=- All prior upgrades (§4Red§a connections)\n- At least one prior upgrade (§9Blue§a connections)
gt.blockmachines.multimachine.FOG.upgradeinfotext.5=Upgrades can be refunded by pressing the §bRespec§6 button, but this only works if ALL connected later upgrades are not active/unlocked.
gt.blockmachines.multimachine.FOG.upgradeinfotext.6=The block of upgrades following the unlock of the Heliofusion Exoticizer module are special, as they are what is considered §bThe Split§6. As the name suggests, only one path out of the three may be chosen at first, and the others will be locked. Each path has specialized buffs that are primarily targeted towards a specific module, and thus affect other module types with reduced effect (unless stated otherwise). The amount of unlockable paths depends on the §bAmount of Rings§6 the Forge has, which in turn is limited by later upgrades.

gt.blockmachines.multimachine.FOG.milestoneinfotext.1=Milestones are essential for upgrading the Forge, as they are the source of §bGraviton Shards§6, the main currency needed for unlocking upgrades. In essence, milestones are just what their name suggests, thresholds that when reached, grant Graviton Shards.
gt.blockmachines.multimachine.FOG.milestoneinfotext.2=There are four types of milestones, Charge, Conversion, Catalyst and Composition, each referring to a stat of the Forge. Each milestone has §bseven§6 tiers, each being harder to reach than the last, but also granting more Graviton Shards. The first tier grants 1 Shard, the second 2, the third 3 and so on.
gt.blockmachines.multimachine.FOG.milestoneinfotext.3=The §bCharge§6 milestone scales off total power consumption of all modules combined, the first tier being unlocked at §b1e15§6 EU consumed, and each subsequent milestone scaling by §b9x§6.
gt.blockmachines.multimachine.FOG.milestoneinfotext.4=The §bConversion§6 milestone scales off total recipes processed across all modules (excluding the Helioflare Power Forge's furnace mode) and its first tier is unlocked at §b10M§6 processed recipes. Following tiers scale by §b4x§6.
gt.blockmachines.multimachine.FOG.milestoneinfotext.5=The §bCatalyst§6 milestone is based on the Forge's fuel consumption, counted in Stellar Fuel units (the number entered in the fuel config menu). Reaching the first tier requires §b10,000§6 fuel units to be consumed, and each tier above scales by §b3x§6.
gt.blockmachines.multimachine.FOG.milestoneinfotext.6=Last but not least, the §bComposition§6 milestone works a bit differently, as it scales off the Forge's structure. Milestone levels are granted for each unique type of module present in the structure (Heliofusion Exoticizer modules on Quark Gluon and Magmatter Modes count as unique), and for each additional ring built.
gt.blockmachines.multimachine.FOG.milestoneinfotext.7=你的研究顯示，如果所有里程碑都達到最終等級，可能會發生一些奇怪的事情……記得回來看看！

gt.blockmachines.multimachine.FOG.inversioninfotext.1=Once all milestones of the Forge reach §bTier 7§6, inversion activates. This uncaps the maximum tier of all milestones and allows it to scale §binfinitely§6.
gt.blockmachines.multimachine.FOG.inversioninfotext.2=The scaling of each milestone changes from exponential to linear, but the granted Graviton Shard amount keeps increasing. The amount of progress needed for each subsequent milestone is as much as needed for the §b7th tier§6 of each milestone.
gt.blockmachines.multimachine.FOG.inversioninfotext.3=The Composition milestone is once again an exception, as that continues to scale by 1 each tier, with its own formula for calculating progress. Each module type is given a value, ranging from §b1§6 for the Helioflare Power Forge to §b5§6 for the Heliofusion Exoticizer in Magmatter Mode, then the amount of each module present is subtracted by 1 and multiplied by its value. These values are added up and divided by 5, this is the final milestone tier on top of the base 7.

